  "body": "In Event standard, the composed property of mouseover event is true.\r\nIn theory, mouseover event should propagates across the shadow.\r\n\r\nBut when moving between elements inside the shadow dom, I can't get the event.\r\n\r\nExample: https://codepen.io/Woody-lxf/pen/QWJYrBy\r\n\r\n- Move from shadow outside to inside, can got it.\r\n- Move from slot to shadow inside, can got it.\r\n- Move from the section to span (both inside shadow), can't got it.\r\n\r\nThe behavior happened on both Chrome, Firefox and Safari.\r\nBut the mousemove event can always be got.\r\n\r\nQuestion:\r\nIs this the right behavior, any description about it?",
